      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"maximized windowed fullscreen\"\n\nI'm happy with how VRChat does the windows over in VR mode, but I think you should be clear on what you want the devs to do. Otherwise they might just ignore it. \n\nDouble click the title bar, now you're in maximized windowed\n\nOr, ALT+Enter, now you're in \"Windowed fullscreen\" which is different from exclusive fullscreen.",
