  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-09T23:12:00.622Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The vrchat window opens in non maximized window mode which is annoying to have to maximize it all the way each time playing on desktop. It also might be a performance cost in vr if it is drawing a smaller window onto the desktop. the reprojection screen and everything behind it depending on the users desktop could cause some extra steps the gpu has to process and maximizing as much performance in vr is a good thing. Even if not for performance then it should just be an ease of life thing to feel less clucky. It should just open in windowed fullscreen anyways by default and not in a small window that almost covers the entire screen.",
